## Interface: 120100
## Title: Auction Assistant
## Notes: Companion addon for the Crafting & Auction Assistant desktop app. Shows the app's last-synced item prices on tooltips, zone values on the world map, mob/skinning values on unit tooltips, and gathering node values on herb/ore tooltips. Scans the Auction House on request (/aascan).
